  "cnpj": "02332886000104"
}

### 3.2 [ERRO] Investidor tentando cadastrar corretora — 403 AUT-007
POST {{baseUrl}}/corretoras
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "cnpj": "02332886000104"
}

### 3.3 [ERRO] CNPJ com formato inválido — 400 VAL-001 (falha no @Pattern do DTO)
POST {{baseUrl}}/corretoras
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenAdmin}}

